      <li><a href="https://fileflex.com/company/blog/">Blog</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://fileflex.com/fileflex-enterprise/try-plus/" class="ff-nav__cta">Try FileFlex</a></li>
    </ul>
    <label class="ff-nav__hamburger" for="ff-nav-toggle" aria-hidden="true">&#9776;</label>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="ff-hero" aria-labelledby="ff-hero-heading">
  <div class="ff-hero__content">
    <h1 id="ff-hero-heading">
      Secure the <span class="text-orange">Data Layer</span><br />
      of Zero Trust
    </h1>
    <p class="ff-hero__sub">
      <strong>80% of All Corporate Data is Unstructured:</strong><br />
      Identity Locked | Network Locked | Application Locked<br />
      Data Remains <span class="underline">Wide Open</span>
    </p>
    <a class="ff-btn-play" href="#ff-modal" aria-label="Watch: The Missing Security Layer That Truly Matters">
      <span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Watch: The Missing Security Layer That Truly Matters
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     PROBLEM / SOLUTION
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="ff-problem" aria-labelledby="ff-problem-heading">
  <p class="ff-eyebrow ff-eyebrow--center">The Zero Trust Data Gap</p>
  <h2 id="ff-problem-heading" class="section-title white">
    Hackers Don't <u>Steal</u> Your Network.<br />
    <span class="text-orange">They <u>Steal</u> Your Data.</span>
  </h2>
  <div class="ps-grid">
    <div class="ps-col">
      <div class="ps-row">
        <div class="ps-text">
          <h3 class="text-orange">The Problem:</h3>
          <p class="white">
            Today's Zero Trust Security Infrastructure Falls Short.
            Today Zero Trust compliance stops at identity, networks, and applications.
            Unstructured Data remains at risk.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-media">
          <img src="https://fileflex.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Screenshot__654_-removebg-preview.png.webp" alt="The problem — unstructured data is exposed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ps-col">
      <div class="ps-row">
        <div class="ps-text">
          <h3 class="text-orange">The Solution:</h3>
          <p class="white">
            <strong>Zero Trust Data Security.</strong><br />
            Zero Trust Data Access completes your Zero Trust strategy in the data layer.
            It applies least privilege, just-in-time, and governance controls directly
            to files wherever they reside — without moving them.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-media">
          <img src="https://fileflex.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/this_too-removebg-preview.png.webp" alt="The solution — Zero Trust Data Access" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://fileflex.com/blog/the-zero-trust-data-gap/" class="btn-orange">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     EXPLORE NAV BAR
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="ff-explore-nav" aria-label="Page section navigation">
  <div class="ff-explore-nav__inner">
    <span class="ff-explore-nav__label">Explore FileFlex Enterprise</span>
    <nav class="ff-explore-nav__links">
      <a href="#ff-meet">Meet FileFlex Enterprise</a>
      <a href="#ff-use">Use Cases</a>
      <a href="#ff-transform">Transform Data Workflows</a>
